[183.339857, "o", "\u001b[29A\u001b[1G\u001b[KLet me find the skill dir and run context without command substitution.\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;208m\u25b6 \u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;35m\u25cf \u001b[39m\u001b[2mRan bash(/tmp/imp-src/tests/oracle/workspaces/ctx-pin/.c...) 4.7s\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[KThe skill is active. Let me run the context setup and load the critique reference.\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;208m\u25b6 \u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;35m\u25cf \u001b[39m\u001b[2mRan bash(NO_PRODUCT_MD: This project has no PRODUCT.md y...) 0.0s\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[KThis is a scoped critique on existing code \u2014 no PRODUCT.md needed. Let me load the critique\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[Kreference, then the craft-floor before editing.\r\r\n\u001b[E\u001b[10G\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;208m\u001b[39m\u001b[38;5;35m\u001b[39m\u001b[2mfile_read([type: text, 855 lines, 48158 chars]) 0.0s\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[E\u001b[1G\u001b[KNow let me run the detector on plain.html as part of the critique.\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;208m\u25b6 \u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;35m\u25cf \u001b[39m\u001b[2mRan bash([]) 0.0s\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[KThe detector returns clean (an unstyled button has no styling to flag). Now let me read the\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[Kcraft-floor before building the polished version.\r\r\n\u001b[E\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;208m\u25b6 \u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;35m\u25cf \u001b[39m\u001b[2mRan file_read([type: text, 53 lines, 7158 chars]) 0.0s\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;136m|\u001b[39m Simmering \u001b[2m0.0s\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[E\u001b[E\u001b[E\u001b[18G\u001b[K       \u001b[92m\u28a0\u28fa\u28d7\u2844\u001b[39m        \u001b[36m\u28a0\u28fa\u28d7\u2844\u001b[39m     \u001b[93m\u28e0\u28be\u2877\u001b[35m\u28a0\u28fa\u28d7\u2844\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[18G\u001b[K       \u001b[92m\u2894\u281d\u282b\u